# Longbridge data integration. This template contains no real credentials.
# Production: inject all three values through your cloud Secret manager.
# Local/VM: copy to a PRIVATE file outside the checkout, fill it there, and set
# AKSHARE_QUOTE_ENV_FILE to that absolute path (or use --env-file in the CLI).
# The application does NOT auto-discover .env files or hard-code a local path.
LONGBRIDGE_APP_KEY=
LONGBRIDGE_APP_SECRET=
LONGBRIDGE_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# Alternative: omit the three value variables above and inject Secret file paths.
# LONGBRIDGE_APP_KEY_FILE=/run/secrets/longbridge_app_key
# LONGBRIDGE_APP_SECRET_FILE=/run/secrets/longbridge_app_secret
# LONGBRIDGE_ACCESS_TOKEN_FILE=/run/secrets/longbridge_access_token
# Do not set a value variable together with its corresponding _FILE variable.
# AKSHARE_QUOTE_ENV_FILE=/etc/akshare/longbridge.env
